"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\"><span style=\" font-"
"family:'Bitstream Vera Sans';\">Note: The collected data is not used by "
"Lancelot at the moment, but will be in the future. Leaving this option \"on"
"\" will ensure that, once the features that depend on usage statistics are "
"implemented, you will not need to train them.</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\"-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; "
